@startuml 00-overview-and-locking
title Geonera Ingestion — 0. Overview: Trigger, Parent Handler & Advisory Lock

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #1B1B1B
skinparam ArrowColor #546E7A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #37474F

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #546E7A
  FontColor #1B1B1B
  FontSize 13

  BackgroundColor<<lock>> #EF6C00
  FontColor<<lock>> #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<lock>> #A34B00

  BackgroundColor<<db>> #1565C0
  FontColor<<db>> #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<db>> #0B3C78

  BackgroundColor<<r2>> #2E7D32
  FontColor<<r2>> #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<r2>> #1B5E20

  BackgroundColor<<api>> #AD1457
  FontColor<<api>> #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<api>> #6A0F38
}

skinparam activityDiamond {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3CD
  BorderColor #C79100
  FontColor #5D4037
}

skinparam legend {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #90A4AE
  FontColor #1B1B1B
  FontSize 12
  EntrySeparatorColor #CFD8DC
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9A227
  FontColor #3E3E3E
}

legend right
  |= Tag |= Meaning |
  |<back:#EF6C00><color:#FFFFFF> lock </color></back>| Advisory-lock / Parent Handler step |
  |<back:#1565C0><color:#FFFFFF> db </color></back>| PostgreSQL transaction (state / outbox) |
  |<back:#2E7D32><color:#FFFFFF> r2 </color></back>| Cloudflare R2 storage I/O |
  |<back:#AD1457><color:#FFFFFF> api </color></back>| External Dukascopy API call |
endlegend

|#E8EAF6|MQ / Trigger|
|#FFF3E0|Parent Handler (Lock Layer)|
|#ECF6EF|Worker Group (Pool Connection)|

start

|MQ / Trigger|
:Message received from one of the queues;
note right
  6 Main Queues -> 6 Main Processes:
  1) jobs.ticks.regular     -> Ticks Regular        (every hour, minute :05)
  2) jobs.ticks.backfill    -> Backfill Ticks       (every 10 minutes)
  3) jobs.candles.regular   -> Candles Regular      (seed 00:00 UTC, aggregate 05:08 UTC)
  4) jobs.candles.backfill  -> Backfill Candles     (every 20 minutes, from minute :04)
  5) jobs.maintenance       -> Maintenance          (every 5 minutes, from minute :02)
  6) jobs.sync              -> Sync (Outbox Worker) (every 5 minutes)

  See the detailed flow of each process in:
   01-ticks-regular.puml
   02-backfill-ticks.puml
   03-candles-regular.puml
   04-backfill-candles.puml
   05-maintenance.puml
   06-sync-outbox.puml
end note

switch (Which queue triggered it?)
case ( jobs.ticks.regular / jobs.ticks.backfill )
  :runTickParentHandler(mode);<<lock>>
  note right: mode = REGULAR or BACKFILL
case ( jobs.candles.regular / jobs.candles.backfill )
  :runCandleParentHandler(mode);<<lock>>
  note right: mode = REGULAR or BACKFILL
case ( jobs.maintenance )
  :runMaintenanceHandler();<<lock>>
case ( jobs.sync )
  :runSyncHandler();<<lock>>
endswitch

|Parent Handler (Lock Layer)|
:dal.AcquireAdvisoryLock(ctx)
**Direct Connection** (bypass PgBouncer);
:pg_try_advisory_xact_lock(LockID);
note right
  Lock ID constants (avoid magic numbers):
  LockIDTick        = 1001  -> Ticks Regular & Backfill
  LockIDCandle      = 1002  -> Candles Regular & Backfill
  LockIDMaintenance = 1003  -> Auto-Seeder & Pruning
  LockIDSync        = 1004  -> Outbox Worker
end note

if (Lock acquired?) then (no / already held by another instance)
  :Record span event "lock already acquired,
  skipping execution";
  stop
else (yes, exclusive lock obtained)
endif

:Start Lock Health Monitor goroutine
(heartbeat 'SELECT true' every 30s via lockCtx,
cancels the whole ETL context if the
direct connection drops — HA failover safety);
:Fork child goroutines (wg.Add + go func),
each carrying lockCtx (OTel trace) & DAL.pool
(PgBouncer connection for fast claim/update);

note right
  REGULAR mode forks 3 goroutines: T-0, T-1, T-2
  BACKFILL mode forks 1 goroutine:  Master Bulk-Claim (claim up to 120 rows,
                                    route in-memory to Ingestion/Reset/Validation)
  MAINTENANCE forks 4 goroutines:   A (Forward Seeding), B (Backward Gap Fill),
                                    C (Pruning), D (Consistency Check)
  Each child MUST register deferred panic-recovery
  + defer wg.Done() so the lock is never held hostage.
end note

:wg.Wait() — wait for all forked
sub-processes to finish (Fork-Join);

|Parent Handler (Lock Layer)|
:cancelETL() — stop the Lock Health Monitor;
:tx.Rollback() — release
pg_try_advisory_xact_lock (defer guarantee,
runs even on panic / context cancel);
stop

@enduml
